diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index daa24dc3505a8f7866dd497fdaa5c892a5f5f41a..2bc0a3b96f4baf7d2bd55106b445c9bf2bd8748b 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -16,6 +16,10 @@ bookings are allowed; overlapping bookings for the same item are rejected.
 Quotes do not reserve equipment or check availability. State lasts only as long
 as the service instance.
 
+`availability({ start, end, kind? })` returns sorted equipment IDs that are free
+for the whole period. Omit `kind` to include both boards and sails. It uses the
+same period rules as bookings and does not reserve equipment.
+
 Cancellation is not implemented yet. When added, a cancellation less than 24 hours
 before the booking's start receives no refund; otherwise the full amount is
 refunded, including at exactly 24 hours before the start.
